    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NADINE: Motherfucker.\nKRISTA: It's Krista, leave a message and try to keep it short because I think I have ADD. No, I'm serious.\nNADINE: Your stupid voicemail lady cut me off and it wasn't very good fricking timing.\nNADINE: Anyway, as I was saying: I'm never talking to you again. This friendship... is officially over.",
      "NADINE: Krista and I had been best friends since the day we met back in the Spring of 2nd grade.\nKRISTA: My name's Krista, what's yours?\nNADINE: Nadine Hamidi Yousefa Rostami.\nKRISTA: Wow, that's abuncha words. You're real good at the Ken, too.",
      "KRISTA: Whaddaya think?\nNADINE: Woooooowwwwww.",
      "KRISTA: We have to relocate. The penistree smells like barf.\nNADINE: I love the penistree, it's been our spot since freshman year.\nKRISTA: Ehh. I feel like we need a change.\nNADINE: That should've been my first clue: Change. But I was too busy scouring the quad for--",
      "NADINE: I said I'd take the bus!\nJERRY: What's this dipshit doing? Hey dipshit!\nJERRY: Do you not see the Loading Zone sign, or are you just an asshole?"
    ]
